<title>SPAIN: Spain could create 330,000/370,000 new jobs in 97.</title>
<headline>Spain could create 330,000/370,000 new jobs in 97.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Labour Secretary Manuel Pimientel said on Thursday that forecasts for 330,000-370,000 new jobs in 1997 were &quot;reasonable&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;When at the end of the 1996 we presented our forecasts for 234,000 new jobs (in 1997), we were considered to be optimist..a few months later we announced that we would surpass that level,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
<p>Most recent forecasts ranged between 330,000 and 370,000 new jobs during 1997, he said.</p>
<p>&quot;To me these very reasonable ranges for the creation of new jobs (this year),&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
